From da76349f95da474043e3a993d6c620c81ef2b523 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ed Schofield <ed@aicharmers.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:35:48 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] drm/amd/display: Wait for the iMac 5K right tile at boot
 detection

Boot detection reaches the right tile (link 1) a few milliseconds after
the left tile's detection has set 0x4F1, but the right tile's HPD rises
only 73-83 ms after that write. HPD interrupts are not yet enabled, so
nothing reports the rise, and the right tile is first detected seconds
later, after the first commit has powered the left tile down and up
again. By then the fbdev console has sized its framebuffer for the left
tile alone. Its later probes cannot grow the framebuffer, so they prune
both tiles' 2560x2880 modes and leave the right tile with only the
DisplayPort fail-safe mode.

Before boot detection of the right tile, wait up to 150 ms for its HPD
and a successful DPCD read, as before training it. Its EDID is then read
while the driver loads, and the sink is kept from then on. If the right
tile is still not ready, warn and leave it undetected; a later HPD edge
detects it as before.
---
 .../drm/amd/display/dc/link/link_detection.c  | 22 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/dc/link/link_detection.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/dc/link/link_detection.c
index 36c8f1eec..e69ea4c83 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/dc/link/link_detection.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/dc/link/link_detection.c
@@ -1637,6 +1637,28 @@ bool link_detect(struct dc_link *link, enum dc_detect_reason reason)
 	if (link->local_sink && dc_sink_is_kept_imac5k_tile(link->local_sink))
 		return false;
 
+	/*
+	 * iMac 5K: boot detection reaches the right tile just after the left
+	 * tile's detection has set 0x4F1, before the right tile's HPD rises,
+	 * and no interrupt reports the rise. Wait for its HPD and a DPCD read,
+	 * or leave it undetected.
+	 */
+	if (reason == DETECT_REASON_BOOT && link->dc->config.imac5K_support &&
+	    link->link_index == 1) {
+		unsigned long long start = dm_get_timestamp(link->ctx);
+		uint8_t rev;
+
+		while (!link_get_hpd_state(link) ||
+		       core_link_read_dpcd(link, DP_DPCD_REV, &rev, 1) != DC_OK) {
+			if (dm_get_elapse_time_in_ns(link->ctx, dm_get_timestamp(link->ctx),
+						     start) > 150 * NSEC_PER_MSEC) {
+				DC_LOG_WARNING("iMac 5K: right tile not ready at boot\n");
+				return false;
+			}
+			fsleep(1000);
+		}
+	}
+
 	is_local_sink_detect_success = detect_link_and_local_sink(link, reason);
 
 	if (is_local_sink_detect_success && link->local_sink) {
-- 
